topic on our Web Security Academy.

10
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:09,000
For this demo, we'll be using the Basic SSRF against another back-end system lab from this topic.

11
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Once the lab has launched, identify a request that appears to cause data to be fetched from another back-end system,

12
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:20,000
and use as input control by the user to determine where the data is fetched from.

13
